{"t":"282330.KS","n":"BGF Retail Co., Ltd.","nKo":"BGF리테일","ex":"KSE","cur":"KRW","px":133400.0,"chg":800.0,"chgPct":0.00603,"prev":132600.0,"dayH":134200.0,"dayL":128000.0,"w52H":156600.0,"w52L":101200.0,"vol":66182,"avgVol":51642,"mcap":2304487194624,"pe":null,"fpe":9.01,"eps":null,"feps":null,"pb":null,"div":4100.0,"divY":0.0309,"beta":-0.15,"short":null,"shortPct":null,"shortRatio":null,"prof":{"c":"South Korea","cKo":"대한민국","s":"Consumer Defensive","sKo":"소비자 방어","i":"Grocery Stores","iKo":"식료품점","city":"Seoul","emp":null,"web":"https://www.bgfretail.com","sum":"BGF Retail Co., Ltd., together with its subsidiaries, operates convenience stores under the CU brand in South Korea. The company's stores retail various products, such as quick meals, instant cooking, processed meals, food ingredients, beverages, dairy products, alcohol, confectionery, ice cream, breads, desserts, snacks, tobacco, household and personal goods, hobbies and leisure products, securities and service products, and other products. It is also involved in the sale of products to franchisees through the convenience store chain business; logistics services; advertising, E-commerce, and convenience store delivery; food manufacturing; and oil business. BGF Retail Co., Ltd. was founded in 1990 and is headquartered in Seoul, South Korea.","sumKo":"BGF리테일주식회사는 자회사들과 함께 한국에서 CU 브랜드로 편의점을 운영하고 있습니다. 당사 매장에서는 간편식, 즉석조리식품, 가공식품, 식자재, 음료, 유제품, 주류, 제과, 아이스크림, 빵, 디저트, 스낵, 담배, 생활용품, 취미생활용품, 증권 및 서비스용품, 기타 상품 등 다양한 제품을 판매하고 있습니다. 또한 편의점 체인 사업을 통해 가맹점에 제품을 판매하는 업무에도 참여하고 있습니다. 물류 서비스; 광고, 전자상거래, 편의점 배송; 식품 제조; 그리고 석유 사업. BGF Retail Co., Ltd.는 1990년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 서울에 본사를 두고 있습니다."},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":7615769470000,"ni":198784520000},{"y":2023,"rev":8194800000000,"ni":195800000000},{"y":2024,"rev":8698800000000,"ni":195200000000},{"y":2025,"rev":9061200000000,"ni":195300000000}],"quarterly":[{"q":"4Q2025","rev":2292300000000,"ni":49800000000},{"q":"1Q2026","rev":2120400000000,"ni":29300000000},{"q":"